MacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;margin-bottom: 0px;'>\n<strong style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</strong>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style='white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;margin-bottom: 0px;'>\n<strong style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n           关于Delo\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<br style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style='font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          它与我们在售卖的Shantawene，Bombe同样来自于埃塞俄比亚的西达玛区域的Bensa小镇，不同的是它是来自更小的Delo区域；\n          <span style='font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n           Ta\n          </span>\n<span style='font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n           miru Ta\n          </span>\n<span style='font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n           de\n          </span>\n<span style='font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n           sse Tesema\n          </span>\n          是一个当地的贸易商，他已经进入这个行业8年了，跟随着前辈先驱们学习采购贸易和处理，到最近两年他处理的咖啡连续获得了国际市场的认可，这个批次就是他从Delo周边小农中收来的鲜果，总量约180多吨，然后找处理站进行日晒处理，然后再销售给国际买家，2021年他处理的咖啡提交给CoE竞赛获得了第五名的好成绩。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style='font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          今年我们再次有机会拿到这支豆子，希望大家能一如既往地喜欢它~\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n         风土好+人努力==成功\n        </p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style='font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: justify;'>\n</span>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style='font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='white-space: normal;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;margin-bottom: 0px;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          众号的文章板块有豆子信息\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='white-space: normal;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;margin-bottom: 0px;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          淘宝店铺和有赞小程序可选购更多豆子～\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='white-space: normal;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;margin-bottom: 0px;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Q09FO8svc4MbsT6kYe0icjVt0iafAKEvQb4V0sg5ELeaSJuChicNO6jr9zxGVFVu7wDwt3ibVQgXa5ow/640?wx_fmt=png\" style=\"outline: 0px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;width: 388px !important;visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
